***** The unique application that writes beautiful acrostic poetry for you *****

Did you know that your iPhone can be a poet? Even your iPad can write beautiful poetry.

- Obtain in a flash a declaration of love in acrostic for the name of your choice;
- Millions of possible poems that follow themes and avoid repeating words;
- Poetry written by an author who has been specialised in acrostic for 15 years;
- Choose the poem's background picture among those proposed, or use one of your own;
- Easily share, send or print your poem;
- Write and send poems directly by message with the iMessage extension;
- Write a poem a day with the free version;
- For only $1.99, obtain unlimited poems and the possibility to sign your declaration;

Each verse begins with a letter of the name of the man or woman who you want to dedicate the poem to. You can choose a name, whatever its origin, or a nickname or even the terms of your choice, as long as they do not exceed 16 characters.
The application "Romance - The application to declare your love" writes, in an instant, for you, a pretty love poem that you can offer to the elect of your heart! Want another, on another topic? Your amazing device can compose a new one in a flash!
Beautifully presented, you can even edit it to personalise it even more, send poetry by email or save it to your photo gallery in order to print it from your computer or Airprint, or decorate a Facebook or Twitter post, or even send it by iMessage... It’s up to you to choose your sharing method among all that you have enabled on your mobile!
You can even write poems directly in an iMessage conversation thanks to the iMessage Romance extension included.
The Romance application already offers thousands of combinations, but the author does not stop there: he is committed to regularly adding new rhymes, new themes so that you can always have new and original poems, without even needing an internet connection.
Following advice given by the Apple team – application presented to Tim Cook himself! – Romance never stops being enhanced to give you absolutely unique functionalities.
A superb customised gift (Valentine’s Day, Christmas, birthday, wedding…) that you can make yourself (private use only)!
Romance is the application for love: the love of people, the love of words, the love of beautiful things and touching presents.
You are not convinced? Download Romance for free to put it to the test. The free version allows you to write up to one poem a day (and locked signature). If you want unlimited poems, you will only need to press BUY.
It will only cost you 1.99$/1.99£ and you Romance application will be unlocked. You will be able to use it, infinitely, to have all the poems you wish composed.

About the authors:
Logan Le Rudulier, who has been creating mobile games and applications since he was 13, develops the app itself. Great care has been given to Romance and your opinion on it will be received with pleasure.
Patrice Khal, poet specialised in acrostic for 15 years, writes the verses that harmoniously compose the declarations.

Translator for me is a translation app supporting over 100 languages to translate text, voice and photos.

Features:
* Text translation for more than 100 languages;
* Voice translation to translate speech when speaking;
* Take Photo using camera to translate text in photos and screenshots;
* Sync to iCloud;

